{"message":"I did not apply for any credit card.

I reviewed the available personal-card information and could not verify documented travel-insurance coverage for any personal Rho-Bank credit card. The Silver Rewards Card offers 4% cash back on eligible travel and software purchases and would provide a +0.2% bonus on your personal Gold Account, but the available terms do not state that it includes travel insurance. Therefore, it does not meet your stated requirement.

The documented travel-insurance benefits I found are for business cards, not personal cards. Since you requested a personal card with verified travel protection, I cannot recommend or submit an application for one based on the available information. Your Purple Account’s travel insurance remains active as a checking-account benefit."}
